OL,3,GNEWSAFury v Joshua fight faces
OL,4,Aobjections over 3am finish
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised by residents
OL,7,Fover plans for next month's eagerly
OL,8,Fawaited Tyson Fury v Anthony Joshua
OL,9,Ffight in Cardiff to run into the early
OL,10,Fhours of the morning.
OL,12,FThe all-British heavyweight fight is
OL,13,Fdue to take place at Principality
OL,14,FStadium on 11 December, with the event
OL,15,Fexpected to finish at 03:00 GMT the
OL,16,Ffollowing day to align with prime-time
OL,17,Fviewing in the United States.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
