OL,3,GNEWSAFury v Joshua fight faces
OL,4,Aobjections over 3am finish
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut as part of the stadium's
OL,7,Fapplication to extend licensing hours,
OL,8,FCardiff Council has received objections
OL,9,Frelated to concerns about anti-social
OL,10,Fbehaviour, noise, traffic and public
OL,11,Fsafety.
OL,13,FThe council's licensing subcommittee
OL,14,Fwill meet to discuss the proposals on
OL,15,F25 November.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
